  "answer": "I couldn't find an earlier ticket that reports this exact problem: the \"show all results\" search page in the Command Palette settings window is misaligned when the window is very wide. The closest tickets are about different pages. PowerToys#46238, #46279 and #46475 cover the Command Palette page in the main PowerToys Settings window being misaligned or clipped on resize or maximize. PowerToys#41597 covers misaligned breadcrumbs in the CmdPal settings window. None of them covers the search results page. Please keep this ticket open as a new bug. It would help to add your screen resolution and display scaling, and to note that it only happens with a very wide window. As a workaround, narrow the settings window until the page lines up again."
 },
